        "rus-staffing"
      ]
    },
    "reverse/5": {
      "text": "Serbia complained that the Mechanism refused Ratko Mladić's temporary medical release despite Serbian guarantees, yet affirmed its commitment to prosecuting war crimes regardless of nationality. Peru urged Council unity, stating that combating impunity depends on states enforcing sentences, executing warrants, and answering assistance requests. Both positions were recorded without a verified vote or decision in this supplement.",
